@startuml Casos de uso - Entradas y salidas
title Gestion de entrada y salida de vehiculos - Casos de uso
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Usuario autenticado" as Usuario
actor "Operario" as Operario
actor "Administrador" as Administrador
Usuario <|-- Operario
Usuario <|-- Administrador

rectangle "Modulo de gestion de entradas y salidas" {
  usecase "Consultar contratos\ny estado del vehiculo" as UCContratos
  usecase "Consultar celdas\ndisponibles y compatibles" as UCCeldas
  usecase "Registrar entrada" as UCEntrada
  usecase "Validar contrato y vigencia" as UCContrato
  usecase "Verificar estado dentro/fuera\n(Anti-Passback)" as UCAntiPassback
  usecase "Validar disponibilidad y\ncompatibilidad de celda" as UCCeldaValida
  usecase "Registrar daños\npreexistentes" as UCDanos
  usecase "Autorizar acceso excepcional" as UCExcepcional
  usecase "Registrar novedad de\nacceso excepcional" as UCNovedadEx
  usecase "Registrar salida" as UCSalida
  usecase "Liberar celda asociada" as UCLiberar
  usecase "Guardar transito inmutable" as UCTransito
  usecase "Rechazar operacion y\nmantener datos sin cambios" as UCRechazo
}

Usuario --> UCContratos
Usuario --> UCCeldas
Usuario --> UCEntrada
Usuario --> UCSalida
Usuario --> UCDanos
Administrador --> UCExcepcional

UCEntrada ..> UCContrato : <<include>>
UCEntrada ..> UCAntiPassback : <<include>>
UCEntrada ..> UCCeldaValida : <<include>>
UCEntrada ..> UCTransito : <<include>>
UCDanos ..> UCEntrada : <<extend>>
UCExcepcional ..> UCEntrada : <<extend>>
UCExcepcional ..> UCNovedadEx : <<include>>
UCSalida ..> UCAntiPassback : <<include>>
UCSalida ..> UCLiberar : <<include>>
UCSalida ..> UCTransito : <<include>>
UCRechazo ..> UCEntrada : <<extend>>
UCRechazo ..> UCSalida : <<extend>>

note bottom of UCEntrada
  Requiere sesion activa.
  Para Operario, requiere caja abierta a su nombre.
  Administrador puede ejecutar el transito sin caja.
  Anti-Passback aplica al vehiculo/placa aunque se use otro contrato;
  mientras este dentro, se muestra su celda y no se ofrece otra asignacion.
  La celda y el transito se actualizan en una transaccion.
end note

note right of UCExcepcional
  Se valida documento, rol Administrador
  y contraseña de confirmacion.
  La novedad excepcional es obligatoria.
  La autorizacion forma parte de la solicitud;
  no se guarda como una entidad de autorizacion.
end note

note right of UCTransito
  Los registros de transito no se pueden
  actualizar ni eliminar.
end note
@enduml

@startuml Clases - Entradas y salidas
title Gestion de entrada y salida de vehiculos - Diagrama de clases
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "API y logica de aplicacion" {
  class "transits.py" as TransitModule <<module>> {
    {static} register_entry(payload, operator)
    {static} register_exit(payload, operator)
    {static} verify_exceptional_administrator(cursor, authorization)
  }

  class "EntryRequest" as EntryRequest <<request DTO>> {
    +contract_id: int
    +cell_id: int
    +exceptional_authorization: ExceptionalAuthorization?
    +physical_novelties: PhysicalNovelty[]
  }

  class "ExitRequest" as ExitRequest <<request DTO>> {
    +contract_id: int
  }

  class "ExceptionalAuthorization" as ExceptionalAuthorization <<request DTO>> {
    +administrator_document: str
    +administrator_password: str
    +novelty: str
  }

  class "PhysicalNovelty" as PhysicalNovelty <<request DTO>> {
    +damage_type: str
    +description: str
    +severity: str
  }

  class "domain.py" as DomainModule <<module>> {
    {static} compatible_cell(vehicle_type, category): bool
    {static} require_entry_permission(status, expires_on, today, exceptional)
  }

  class "cash.py" as CashModule <<module>> {
    {static} require_open_cash(cursor, user_id): CashOpening
  }

  class "database.py" as DatabaseModule <<module>> {
    {static} transaction(): cursor
  }

  class "cells.py" as CellsModule <<module>> {
    {static} list_cells(vehicle_type?): Cell[]
  }

  class "novelties.py" as NoveltiesModule <<module>> {
    {static} record_novelty(cursor, transit_id, type, description, severity, recorded_by)
  }
}

package "Registros persistidos en MySQL" {
  class "User" as User <<table users>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    document: VARCHAR(30)
    role: ENUM
  }

  class "Contract" as Contract <<table contracts>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    customer_id: BIGINT
    vehicle_id: BIGINT
    status: ENUM
    expires_on: DATE?
  }

  class "Vehicle" as Vehicle <<table vehicles>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    plate: VARCHAR(6)
    vehicle_type: ENUM
  }

  class "Cell" as Cell <<table cells>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    label: VARCHAR(30)
    category: ENUM
    status: ENUM
  }

  class "Transit" as Transit <<table transits>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    vehicle_id: BIGINT
    contract_id: BIGINT
    cell_id: BIGINT
    operator_id: BIGINT
    direction: ENUM
    occurred_at: DATETIME(6)
  }

  class "Novelty" as Novelty <<table novelties>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    transit_id: BIGINT
    novelty_type: ENUM
    damage_type: ENUM?
    description: VARCHAR(1000)
    severity: ENUM?
    recorded_by: BIGINT
  }

  class "CashOpening" as CashOpening <<table cash_openings>> {
    +id: BIGINT
    user_id: BIGINT
    opened_at: DATETIME(6)
    closed_at: DATETIME(6)?
  }
}

TransitModule ..> EntryRequest : recibe
TransitModule ..> ExitRequest : recibe
EntryRequest *-- "0..1" ExceptionalAuthorization : autorizacion opcional
EntryRequest *-- "0..*" PhysicalNovelty : daños opcionales
TransitModule ..> DomainModule : valida reglas
TransitModule ..> CashModule : exige caja al Operario
TransitModule ..> DatabaseModule : abre transaccion
CellsModule ..> DomainModule : filtra compatibilidad
TransitModule ..> NoveltiesModule : persiste novedades
TransitModule ..> User : autentica operador y administrador
TransitModule ..> Contract : consulta contrato y estado
TransitModule ..> Vehicle : obtiene vehiculo del contrato
TransitModule ..> Cell : valida y actualiza ocupacion
TransitModule ..> Transit : inserta entrada o salida
NoveltiesModule ..> Novelty : inserta novedad
CashModule ..> CashOpening : verifica apertura activa

Contract "0..*" --> "1" Vehicle : vehicle_id
Transit "0..*" --> "1" Vehicle : vehicle_id
Transit "0..*" --> "1" Contract : contract_id
Transit "0..*" --> "1" Cell : cell_id
Transit "0..*" --> "1" User : operator_id
Novelty "0..*" --> "1" Transit : transit_id
Novelty "0..*" --> "1" User : recorded_by
CashOpening "0..*" --> "1" User : user_id

note bottom of TransitModule
  El backend implementa endpoints y logica en modulos
  y funciones, no en clases de servicio ni entidades ORM.
  Los elementos <<module>> representan esos modulos;
  las entidades representan filas de las tablas MySQL.
end note

note right of Transit
  Solo se insertan registros.
  Triggers MySQL impiden UPDATE y DELETE.
end note

note right of Cell
  La entrada cambia Libre a Ocupado.
  La salida cambia la celda asociada a Libre.
  La misma placa no puede ocupar otra celda antes de registrar salida.
end note
@enduml
